    <briefdescription>
<para>This modules provide an interface to libLLVMCore, which implements the LLVM intermediate representation as well as other related types and utilities. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Many exotic languages can interoperate with C code but have a harder time with C++ due to name mangling. So in addition to C, this interface enables tools written in such languages. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
